								<a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php?action=profile;u=35"><img src="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/Themes/safgrey105/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.myspace.com/blindsage" title="" target="_blank"><img src="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/Themes/safgrey105/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
